OL,3,AEvacuations ordered in Tokyo as
OL,4,Apowerful typhoon threatens floods and
OL,5,Alandslides
OL,6,
OL,7,FJapan is bracing for record rainfall
OL,8,Ffrom a powerful typhoon expected to
OL,9,Fmove close to Tokyo on the country's
OL,10,Feastern coast
OL,12,FAuthorities have issued a rare
OL,13,Fevacuation emergency alert, fearing the
OL,14,Fstorm could trigger landslides and
OL,15,Ffloods
OL,17,FSome 300 flights have been cancelled
OL,18,Fand some train services suspended
OL,20,FThe worst is likely to come in the next
OL,21,Fcouple of hours, writes our Tokyo
OL,22,Fcorrespondent
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
