OL,3,AEvacuations ordered in Tokyo as
OL,4,Apowerful typhoon threatens floods and
OL,5,Alandslides
OL,6,
OL,7,FDujuan, Japan's 25th storm of the year,
OL,8,Fhas sustained winds of 130km/h
OL,9,F(80.8mph) and gusts of up to 194km/h.
OL,10,FIt could bring up to 350mm of rain to
OL,11,Fthe Tokai region
OL,13,FThe storm is the latest in a wave of
OL,14,Fstorms in the Pacific, made more
OL,15,Fintense by this year's "super El Nino",
OL,16,Fwhich has warmed the ocean and fuelled
OL,17,Fthe formation of storms
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
